    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13770" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-σπάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>torn off from,</i>
			
